{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Void Flesh</i></strong> is a survival horror FPS that follows your trek into the Astaria Research Facility which has gone radio silent two weeks prior to your arrival. Navigate the tight corridors of the facility and survive using only a tight arsenal of weapons and your wit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/28844c5132f6599229aebb79a0f688c8.poster.avif?t=1759384334\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/28844c5132f6599229aebb79a0f688c8.webm?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/28844c5132f6599229aebb79a0f688c8.mp4?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hobbling, fleshy <strong>mutations</strong> and <strong>void-born</strong> entities that want nothing more than to see you join their collective insanity.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Astaria Research Facility is full of <strong>environmental hazards</strong> and <strong>heavy objects</strong> for you to use to your advantage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/5053d4d52d2692f118f7920aac0f4a40.poster.avif?t=1759384334\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/5053d4d52d2692f118f7920aac0f4a40.webm?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/5053d4d52d2692f118f7920aac0f4a40.mp4?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tight, intricate, <strong>hand-crafted</strong> sectors of the Astaria Research Facility. Whether it's following the clear path or taking secret passages, it's all up to you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>environment</strong> to your advantage. Mantle onto various surfaces and use the items around you to forge your own path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/d3d0c0ccdc68dbc7d1c4a89a21eca0db.poster.avif?t=1759384334\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/d3d0c0ccdc68dbc7d1c4a89a21eca0db.webm?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/d3d0c0ccdc68dbc7d1c4a89a21eca0db.mp4?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tight,\u00a0<strong>purposeful arsenal</strong> that can meet any situation. A heavy wrench, precise nail gun,\u00a0 flash grenade and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility is full of <strong>secret areas</strong> and hidden loot to discover using problem solving and environmental queues.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742050?t=1759384334","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742050?t=1759384334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/4fd7164af3632066d35b702a2fc15ef6eb6d69bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759384334","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/4fd7164af3632066d35b702a2fc15ef6eb6d69bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759384334","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"demos":[{"appid":3742060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Void Flesh</i></strong> is a survival horror FPS that follows your trek into the Astaria Research Facility which has gone radio silent two weeks prior to your arrival. Navigate the tight corridors of the facility and survive using only a tight arsenal of weapons and your wit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/28844c5132f6599229aebb79a0f688c8.poster.avif?t=1759384334\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/28844c5132f6599229aebb79a0f688c8.webm?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/28844c5132f6599229aebb79a0f688c8.mp4?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hobbling, fleshy <strong>mutations</strong> and <strong>void-born</strong> entities that want nothing more than to see you join their collective insanity.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Astaria Research Facility is full of <strong>environmental hazards</strong> and <strong>heavy objects</strong> for you to use to your advantage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/5053d4d52d2692f118f7920aac0f4a40.poster.avif?t=1759384334\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/5053d4d52d2692f118f7920aac0f4a40.webm?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/5053d4d52d2692f118f7920aac0f4a40.mp4?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tight, intricate, <strong>hand-crafted</strong> sectors of the Astaria Research Facility. Whether it's following the clear path or taking secret passages, it's all up to you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>environment</strong> to your advantage. Mantle onto various surfaces and use the items around you to forge your own path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/d3d0c0ccdc68dbc7d1c4a89a21eca0db.poster.avif?t=1759384334\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/d3d0c0ccdc68dbc7d1c4a89a21eca0db.webm?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/extras/d3d0c0ccdc68dbc7d1c4a89a21eca0db.mp4?t=1759384334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tight,\u00a0<strong>purposeful arsenal</strong> that can meet any situation. A heavy wrench, precise nail gun,\u00a0 flash grenade and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility is full of <strong>secret areas</strong> and hidden loot to discover using problem solving and environmental queues.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Benjamin Shantz"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742050/7c670e75bc45e32be602b93b249ea6ccca580c7b/header.jpg?t=1759384334","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3742050/300897412/53ce6f005e3b5129da5f6f1b3ce88e27de56e0be/1750385265/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749798268","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3742050/300897412/53ce6f005e3b5129da5f6f1b3ce88e27de56e0be/1750385265/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749798268","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3742050/300897412/53ce6f005e3b5129da5f6f1b3ce88e27de56e0be/1750385265/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749798268","id":257144779,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144779/movie480.mp4?t=1749798268","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144779/movie_max.mp4?t=1749798268"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144779/0121c8b29055bfaf799e0b79aeed9ba8750e4df3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749798268","webm":{"480":"https://vide